<h1>2026年淮安市事业单位统一公开招聘人员拟聘用人员公示（第二批）</h1>
<h3></h3>
<h2>发布时间：2026-08-10 【<a onclick="window.close();">关闭窗口</a>】</h2>
<p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">根据《2026年淮安市事业单位统一公开招聘人员公告》及相关文件规定，现将2026年淮安市事业单位统一公开招聘人员拟聘用人员名单（第二批，共14人）予以公示，如有不同意见，请于2026年8月18日下午5:30前（上午：9:00-11:30，下午：2:00-5:30），通过电话、署名书信或当面向相关部门反映。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">2026年普通高校应届毕业生须按报考相关要求提供毕业证书（学位证书）后，方可办理聘用审批手续。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">监督电话：</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">市纪委监委派驻第五纪检监察组：0517-89668811</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">市纪委监委派驻第十三纪检监察组：0517-83665187</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">附件：</span><a id="ueditorFile_2c9493929fcac71f019feac41c7a31b1" href="/upload/2026-08/72186540-a1dc-440e-8adb-3ec22d1297a2.xls" title="2026年淮安市事业单位统一公开招聘人员拟聘用人员名单（第二批）.xls" style="text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;">2026年淮安市事业单位统一公开招聘人员拟聘用人员名单（第二批）</span></a></p><p class="p4"><br/></p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;中共淮安市委组织部</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 淮安市人力资源和社会保障局</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 